# copod_anomaly.pkl is now COMMITTED: COPOD is fit on a 40k-row subsample
# (train_fraud.py) so the artifact is ~21 MB — small enough for Git and, crucially,
# so prod (Render, which never runs the boot-time regen) loads it directly and
# txn_fraud_ready=true. The PaySim raw CSV stays committed for local retraining.
# Curated .npz subsets and the Colab bundle stay ignored.
ml/data/*
!ml/data/PS_20174392719_1491204439457_log.csv
